  "description": "Your first task is to read this, then go mine all those tasty resources to start. §aAre you ready to begin?§r

Now, you don't want to continue §cwhacking trees by hand§r do you? Your journey should start with the free §2greg mining hammers, axe, and shovel§r, and §2hv prospector§r you obtain from the starting quest page. §9However§r, if these decide to break you can make more in your crafting table.

Just be sure to make the §8mining§r hammer and not the §1normal§r hammer okay?

§oMade that mistake more than I would like to admit§r.

(also here, have enough enderpearls for a magnet upgrade, shh)



