You might be wondering why I did not talk about §evanilla minecraft tools§r, aren't you? Well, §2greg tools§r might be more expensive in the initial investment but they are §afaster§r, have §amore durability§r, and have §bcool effects§r that vanilla minecraft tools simply, don't.

For example, the §2greg axe§r has §aTreefeller§r which takes the durability from the tool to mine an entire tree, which is nice to get those logs that always float above your head.

